STEP B5 CLEANUP PARENT-STACK PROBE: short Win32-captured raw stack for exact player weapon 7 -> 5 cleanup; diagnostic-only.
STEP B6 HIT STARTRECOVER / STOP / REPLACEMENT / UNGATED EMPTY-PRIMARY SUCCESSOR STACK PROBE: player PrimaryFirst outgoing attack-Hit or factual empty-Primary successor stack; diagnostic-only.
STEP B7 COMBATMOVE FULLSTOP STACK PROBE: player sAICombatMoveInstr fullStop=true caller/context stack; diagnostic-only.
